      "text": "CI:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " PRCA that began after any EPO product; serious allergic rxn to Epogen; multidose vials (benzyl EToH) in neonates, infants, preg or lactating women."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
