       }
      ],
      "text": "Raises sz risk in CKD:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " monitor closely for premonitory neuro Sx during the first several mo. Serious allergic rxns (anaphylaxis, angioedema, bronchospasm): stop it permanently. Sus SJS/TEN: stop it STAT."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
